{"id":"expl:packages/core/src/dossier/by-scope.ts@L205","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/core/src/dossier/by-scope.ts","span":{"start":205,"end":210}},"file":"packages/core/src/dossier/by-scope.ts","span":{"start":205,"end":210},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:6b79e023be78a2f27de43597e380c1e516a3d8d2932fbd69fed9671cc635a01f","meta":{"text":"Package members from the prebuilt `incoming` adjacency (incoming `member-of` edges point\nchild→parent; members are the sources), so the package path does NOT re-scan `iterateEdges()` NOR\n`iterate('symbol')`. File + cluster member ids are collected during the caller's single symbol\npass (see {@link buildDossiersByScope}). Include ALL symbol members (callables + types)."}}
